                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1ab17de-b7d0-33f0-b0bb-2856374b088d",
                                        "entry_id": "9cd41e4d-013e-3121-bf5c-46785b0351c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wild boar (Sus scrofa), the wild ancestor of the domesticated pig."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "697daa22-23ba-48cb-8e93-022b8e86ab26",
                                                "sense_id": "c1ab17de-b7d0-33f0-b0bb-2856374b088d",
                                                "text": "And drivers on local roads have encountered traveling boars, which can run at up to 30 miles an hour, according to one local resident, who said a friend’s car collided with a 132-pound animal, totaling the vehicle, as well as killing the boar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c24977cc-dfde-3892-b5ae-c25b855c466c",
                                        "entry_id": "9cd41e4d-013e-3121-bf5c-46785b0351c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male pig."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5a0ebcf-f9d7-4ec2-bfec-b5af578e06fa",
                                                "sense_id": "c24977cc-dfde-3892-b5ae-c25b855c466c",
                                                "text": "\"Bull hogs,\" or boars, which are uncastrated male pigs, tend to have a dark, gamy flesh not appreciated by everyone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8555cae4-b34f-37f7-8509-19ce26d8caa0",
